(11024,'enUS','You have the smell of Skettis on you! Explain yourself!',0),
(11025,'enUS','As you come to understand the shards and crystals, you will be better able to assist us in protecting ourselves and our ogre brethren below.$B$BThe shards themselves get their name from an ancient and now-extinct arakkoan civilization, which used to live atop the mountains here.$B$BDo you have the shards with you?',0),
