(38519,'enUS','I have no patterns for helms or boots.$B$BA tauren who cannot survive a few blows to the hoof has no place in battle. Boots are of little use to us.$B$BA helm is a coward\'s armor. I am sorry if this offends you, but it is true.$B$BLegplates, however, do play a vital role. I will gladly share this pattern with you, once you bring me my father\'s hammer.',0),
